2010-09-06  Salomon Eliasson  <s.eliasson@ltu.se>

	* atmlab-1-0-43

	* math/taylor_diagram.m (taylor_diagram): Added script to create
	the infamous Taylor diagram. It is used to visualize (on a
	circular plot) the inter-comparison of datasets compared to a
	reference data set in terms of STD, RMSD and correlation. See:
	" K. Taylor , Summarizing multiple aspects of model performance in
	a single diagram Journal of Geophysical % Research-Atmospheres,
	2001, V106, D7. " for further details

